OL,3,GNEWSALeaks 'unfixed for months' during
OL,4,Adrought
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised that water
OL,7,Fleaks are not being fixed for months
OL,8,Fdespite severe drought conditions being
OL,9,Fdeclared in parts of southern England.
OL,11,FThe Soapbox Children's Theatre in
OL,12,FPlymouth said there had been a
OL,13,Fstream-like leak outside its building
OL,14,Fin Devonport Park for 10 months before
OL,15,Fit was fixed.
OL,17,FSouth West Water said the leak had been
OL,18,Fidentified as "a private leak, which
OL,19,Fmeant permission was required before
OL,20,Fexcavation work could begin".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
