OL,3,GNEWSALeaks 'unfixed for months' during
OL,4,Adrought
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company said it had repaired more
OL,7,Fthan 26,700 leaks in the last 12
OL,8,Fmonths, with about 30% associated with
OL,9,Fcustomer-owned pipework. It said of the
OL,10,Fleaks fixed in the last year, more than
OL,11,F5,500 were on customer supply pipes.
